        "summary": "Added `bun run build` to the `prebuild` script in `npm-app/package.json` to ensure the `../common` package is compiled before the main build. Downgraded `chalk` dependency from `5.3.0` to `4.1.2` to resolve compatibility issues with the CommonJS build pipeline. Changes affect `npm-app/package.json` and `bun.lockb`.",
