        "text": "The build step that prepares the app now also compiles a shared internal library before assembling the main tool, and a color-formatting add-on was rolled back to an older edition so the assembly process runs cleanly. If you ran a fresh local build, it had been failing midway through compilation; it now completes so you get a working build artifact. This only affects people rebuilding the app from source and is live in the current codebase.",
